=== Editor Contrib - Line Comment Command > comment single line
config: {"autoClosingPairs":[],"surroundingPairs":[],"brackets":[],"lineComment":"!@#","blockComment":["<!@#","#@!>"]}
text: "some text\n\tsome more text"
setSelections 1 1 1 1
cmd editor.action.commentLine
expectText "!@# some text\n\tsome more text"
expectSel 1 5 1 5

